WEBVTT

00:02:57.626 --> 00:03:03.604
(Music)

00:03:03.628 --> 00:03:07.073
I'm Adam Grant, and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:03:07.097 --> 00:03:09.054
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:03:09.078 --> 00:03:11.788
I study how to make work not suck.

00:03:11.812 --> 00:03:12.978
In this show,

00:03:13.002 --> 00:03:16.073
I'm inviting myself inside the minds
of some truly unusual people

00:03:16.097 --> 00:03:19.426
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:03:20.245 --> 00:03:22.174
Today, interview.

00:03:22.198 --> 00:03:23.405
What we're doing wrong,

00:03:23.429 --> 00:03:25.936
and how we can get better
at spotting real potential,

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.111
or real problems,

00:03:27.135 --> 00:03:28.368
in a candidate.

00:03:28.392 --> 00:03:31.113
(Music)